#: ../../library/omv.omv.rst:45
msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the OpenMV debug protocol is currently active (i.e. the "
"cam is connected to the IDE), ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Vraća ``True`` ako je OpenMV protokol za otklanjanje pogrešaka trenutno "
"aktivan (tj. kamera je povezana s IDE-om), ``False`` u suprotnom."

